// A parameterised const whose BODY calls a fn. That call exists only in the
// expansion, so the call graph has to follow expansions to see it at all -
// otherwise `double` is pruned as unreachable and the emitter emits a call to
// a label that is no longer in the file.
//
// Nothing here may mention `double` outside the const body: an argument that
// called it would make it reachable by the old path and hide the bug.

u16 double( u8 n ) => n * 2

const plusOne( u8 n ) = double( n ) + 1

u16 out
out = plusOne( 3 )
